; M4 gate: a `:len 0` PCM loop holds until the host's KEY_OFF (language.md
; §17), which releases it — END to the sample's end, WRAP to silence — and
; the tail plays out (m4-pcm-hold.cmds.json). The fm1 rest keeps the song
; running past the command.
(def-score :pcm-voices 1)
(def-pcm pad :file "pad.wav" :loop-start 9ms :loop-end 36ms)
(pcm1 pad :tempo 120 :mode loop :oct 4 :len 0 c)
(fm1 _1 _1)
